<title>HONG KONG: Nomura sets warrants on China Overseas.</title>
<headline>Nomura sets warrants on China Overseas.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International (Hong Kong) Ltd said on Friday it has issued 550 million American-style call warrants on China Overseas Land and Investments Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$4.1175	PREMIUM	    19.15 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.133361    GEARING	    3.43X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	14.SEP.98	LISTING	    HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE HK$4.575	 MIN EXER LOT     20,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>		     DISCRETION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
